<!--Post: 4722--><!--Time: 1106692628-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4722"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Birdieict<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Birdieict<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, January 25, 2005 - 2:37 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->KAKE is now reporting a new postcard sent to their station with directions to a package, possibly from BTK. Stay tuned.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
