<!--/Post: 4756-->
<!--Post: 4757--><!--Time: 1106716657-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4757"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Freya<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Freya<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, January 25, 2005 - 9:17 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Maybe &#39;cause his ass is gonna fry?  Maybe he&#39;s a short-order cook? Either way, these names are cute, but a bit ridiculous. He went to so much trouble getting his chosen name out, why would he even bother to use a fake one? <BR> <BR>I bet we&#39;ll see a press conference tomorrow with Munyon &#40;sp?&#41;, or at least a reference on the next AMW.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4757-->
<!--Post: 4760--><!--Time: 1106718139-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4760"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Essevi<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Essevi<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Tuesday, January 25, 2005 - 9:42 pm: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Could be S &#40;Serial&#41; Killett &#40;Killer&#41;, who knows?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4760-->
<!--Post: 4773--><!--Time: 1106738245-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#f7f7f7"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4773"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Birdieict<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Birdieict<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, January 26, 2005 - 3:17 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I can&#39;t remember which BTK &#34;expert&#34; made the comment about the cereal box referencing BTK catching the Oteros during breakfast, but could &#39;skillett&#39; back that up?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
<!--/Post: 4773-->
<!--Post: 4777--><!--Time: 1106748662-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4777"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Beck<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Beck<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, January 26, 2005 - 6:11 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->I was shocked to see this on the news here in Florida! They showed the cereal box, where it was found. They showed the number &#34;13&#34; written above the circled &#34;T&#34; in the name of the cereal. I don&#39;t think it was a &#34;13&#34; as much as I think it&#39;s supposed to be a &#34;B&#34;. Or maybe I&#39;m wrong, and it&#39;s a &#34;13&#34; and it&#39;s apart of his chapter list of his life, &#40;Crimelibrary&#39;s 13 is &#34;More clues revealed&#34;&#41;  <BR> <BR>Other than the drawings he&#39;s sent in, does anyone know if this is the first piece of handwriting from BTK?<!--/Text--></td></tr>
