<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4797"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Nancydrew<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Nancydrew<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, January 26, 2005 - 8:12 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Can anyone provide a link to see a picture of this box?  I can&#39;t seem to find it.<!--/Text--></td></tr>
