<!--Post: 4802--><!--Time: 1106757238-->
<!--p:--><tr bgcolor="#cccccc"><td valign=top width=200><a name="POST4802"><font face="Verdana" size="1"><b><!--email--><!--/email--><!--name-->Lorenap<!--/name--></b></a><br>Username: <!--field:uname-->Lorenap<!--/field--><br><br>Registered: <!--field:registered-->1-2005<!--/field--><br><!--field:ip_address--><!--/field--></font></font></td><td valign=top><font face="Verdana" size="1"><table width=100% border=0 cellspacing=0 cellpadding=0><tr><td align=left><font face="Verdana" size="1">Posted on Wednesday, January 26, 2005 - 8:33 am: &nbsp;&nbsp;</font></td><td align=right></td></tr></table><hr noshade size=0><!--Text-->Nancydrew you can see a video of the story broadcast on KSNW news here in Wichita. They do not have the actual box but a copy of it. I&#39;m not computer savvy enough to provide a link but the address is http.//<a href="http://www.ksn.com" target=_top>www.ksn.com</a>    <!--/Text--></td></tr>
